OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FThe Stormont Executive has called for
OL,8,FAndy Burnham to provide "a fair
OL,9,Ffunding envelope" to Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fas the current level "does not provide
OL,11,Fa sufficient basis to fund public
OL,12,Fservices".
OL,14,FThe collective letter signed by all
OL,15,Fministers from the four-party power-
OL,16,Fsharing Executive has also requested a
OL,17,Fmeeting with the Prime Minister who
OL,18,Fhas not visited NI since he entered No
OL,19,F10 on July 20.
OL,26,@pD@YOUqD@QO]rD@VOUtD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/13
