FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FStormont ministers have been unable to
OL,8,Fagree a budget for the current
OL,9,Ffinancial year, with departments
OL,10,Foperating on contingency budgets since
OL,11,FApril.
OL,13,FThe UK Government described the lack
OL,14,Fof a budget as "extremely concerning"
OL,15,Fand said the Executive needs to "come
OL,16,Fforward with a plan for how it intends
OL,17,Fto manage its finances".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FMLAs have consistently made the point
OL,8,Fthat they need more money from the
OL,9,FTreasury to address a funding crisis
OL,10,Ffacing public services.
OL,12,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill said
OL,13,Fthe Executive has "repeatedly made the
OL,14,Fcase to the British Government for a
OL,15,Ffair and sustainable funding package,
OL,16,Fbut our calls have consistently not
OL,17,Fbeen met".
OL,26,@uD@SOUyD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"People here deserve high-quality
OL,8,Fpublic services, but we cannot deliver
OL,9,Fthe transformation they need without
OL,10,Fthe necessary investment," she said.
OL,12,F"The people we represent should not be
OL,13,Fleft paying the price for a failure to
OL,14,Fproperly fund public services here.
OL,16,F"We need action and we need it
OL,17,Furgently."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@ZO]tD@AOUxD@AOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FDeputy First Minister Emma Little-
OL,8,FPengelly said her and the First
OL,9,FMinister "were very clear about the
OL,10,Furgent need to resolve these issues"
OL,11,Fwhen they spoke with Mr Burnham over
OL,12,Fthe phone following his appointment.
OL,14,F"Transforming our public services and
OL,15,Fdelivering real change for the people
OL,16,Fof Northern Ireland is our priority
OL,17,Fbut we cannot do this alone," she said.
OL,26,@qD@JOUrD@dO]vD@AOUyD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"We are committed to working with the
OL,8,FUK Government to deliver economic
OL,9,Fgrowth across the UK, securing a
OL,10,Ffunding envelope that enables us to
OL,11,Finvest in our public services and
OL,12,Fsecure better outcomes for everyone
OL,13,Fliving here."
OL,15,FThe letter reads: "The Executive is
OL,16,Fcommitted to achieving a budget
OL,17,Fposition that is balanced and
OL,18,Fsustainable.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@MO]wD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"However, we need a fair funding
OL,8,Fenvelope that enables transformation
OL,9,Fand supports the delivery of the high-
OL,10,Fquality public services that our
OL,11,Fcitizens rightly expect and deserve.
OL,13,F"The work of Professor Holtham and
OL,14,Frecent analysis by the independent
OL,15,FFiscal Council demonstrate that the
OL,16,FExecutive is not currently being
OL,17,Ffunded on a basis comparable to
OL,18,FScotland and Wales.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"Funding parity with Wales would
OL,8,Fprovide the Executive with an
OL,9,Fadditional #1 billion each year, while
OL,10,Fparity with Scotland would deliver
OL,11,Faround #3 billion more annually.
OL,13,F"This would provide a transformative
OL,14,Fopportunity to advance our shared
OL,15,Fambition of creating an economically
OL,16,Fsuccessful and socially balanced
OL,17,Fsociety.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"The existing funding framework does
OL,8,Fnot provide a sufficient basis to fund
OL,9,Fpublic services, support economic
OL,10,Fgrowth or respond to ongoing cost-of-
OL,11,Fliving pressures."
OL,13,FThe letter then states that
OL,14,Fdiscussions on the new fiscal
OL,15,Fframework "have stalled over the last
OL,16,Fyear, with missed opportunities to
OL,17,Faddress barriers to sustainability".
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@RO]wD@KOUyD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FIt also highlighted as specific areas
OL,8,Ffor concern, the Local Growth Fund,
OL,9,F"whose capital-heavy profile does not
OL,10,Freflect local need" and the position
OL,11,Fof the Troubles Victims' Payments
OL,12,Fscheme.
OL,14,FThe letter concludes: "The
OL,15,Fsustainability of public finances and
OL,16,Fservices cannot be delivered by the
OL,17,FExecutive alone.
OL,26,@qD@AOUrD@SO]vD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"It will only be through joint working
OL,8,Fand delivery from both your Government
OL,9,Fand the Executive that we can deliver
OL,10,Fin the long-term.
OL,12,F"We would welcome an early meeting in
OL,13,Fperson to discuss these matters, and
OL,14,Flook forward to working with you to
OL,15,Fdeliver for people here and to
OL,16,Fbuilding a relationship founded on
OL,17,Ftrust, mutual respect and genuine
OL,18,Fpartnership."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUzD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,FA UK Government spokesperson said:
OL,8,F"The UK Government has provided the
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland Executive with its
OL,10,Flargest real-terms settlement since
OL,11,Fdevolution, totalling an average of
OL,12,F#19.3bn a year over the next three
OL,13,Fyears, as well as almost #390m in
OL,14,Fadditional funding over the Spending
OL,15,FReview period.
OL,17,F"The lack of a budget is extremely
OL,18,Fconcerning and is having an impact on
OL,19,Fthe Executive's ability to plan
OL,20,Feffectively and deliver public
OL,21,Fservices for citizens.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786744250
OL,3,CStormont ministers call on Andy
OL,4,CBurnham to deliver 'fair funding' for
OL,5,CNI
OL,7,F"The Government is working with the
OL,8,FExecutive to help them get agreement
OL,9,Fon a budget. However, the Executive
OL,10,Fneeds to come forward with a plan for
OL,11,Fhow it intends to manage its finances,
OL,12,Fagree a multi-year budget, and
OL,13,Ftransition towards fiscal
OL,14,Fsustainability."
OL,16,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,17,FITVX
